The input model already contains the earlier corrections. I will keep its layers and add an urgency adjustment before them.

A finite ReLU network cannot make a discontinuous value change over all real numbers. I can make this adjustment exact for the float64 inputs used by model.py, including values next to 0.4. I will document this limit.
